": "2574086872868973", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162716_173683813225273_921481625584271360_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=exUfDUp-S2cQ7kNvwFATMcU&_nc_oc=Adkw7jxK78UyL5aXLTv2G4yR4g_CKE4HcbXHmbb24D0f8Yfuc5wi_P0xw7OHd7aHbJI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft1DLy-9eqPo0tr6no_0x4TbSm1763P52KeQCwsr15Hrg&oe=699AE474"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "1713008935524509", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162763_821811624658356_6738265622511091712_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dfqVDCuDG3wQ7kNvwHSMFBP&_nc_oc=Adky9I0qAuuTrFsrh_YYHcWSelehAYA1SE1Zs0hgX9c2qjd26ptV4uqjHwBVh5zEBqo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu7rdrKSnKq1GwLMKaOs9T2cffJsRewkOJE7ys93GAm-g&oe=699B141F"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "913276845770000", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162716_309301642809703_3634431536675160064_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MQY5yLwCToAQ7kNvwHMYd6Z&_nc_oc=AdnblxBYVzlyZwA_7sD7vladGVwIycTvLh2gEPM72zDc5FnXtGnn1ztN43pJx3PbGOY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuA2lcFMqrlqpiaBtkqUHuksyV7RWAd1TzJCT-TFilQVA&oe=699B095E"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "220267052508465", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_322834038196860_322204868838162432_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3Lo46w-P91EQ7kNvwGIUgPJ&_nc_oc=AdnRAxJoz8ejAEHrjia0AXr49iafTdBjbdj65xNvLIBjzZhVgHE0zalCqhf1zx47l-g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuO6w8qZG3Dwni0WeFvr-TgGdZ3kPI1Q28z6yO9pVYHeA&oe=699ADF3E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "75262744_592055948252052_3174710684126543872_n.png", "id": "2273427452851341", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75363516_2273427456184674_5101230653467287889_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EffVI-EnGdoQ7kNvwFzuQzU&_nc_oc=AdmB64Or_jgF3t43glF3FavdyrGC6ObiMvDk1uuN-UARsjV6ZC3vPgKpsFhiRe8ulQo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv_CgXY2a5sSBtEFh1wvhpWVcYaIJMPu8HNFfO3ijvTvQ&oe=699B01F2"}, "display_name": "Fail Factory! Demo", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Casual", "Arcade", "Physics", "Demo"], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in a whimsical robot factory while climbing your way up the corporate ladder from lowly intern to esteemed star employee. In a wacky spectacle of increasing chaos, strive to keep up with the escalating comedy of errors as you operate various assembly lines in a myriad of mini-games. Entrenched in a physics-based, no consequences playground, experience three main types of mini-game stations, all with the goal to help the factory build robots on a massive scale. \n \nWorking in assembly stations, sorting stations and quality assurance protocol (QAP), where you\u2019ll control unfathomably large robots, you\u2019ll hone your skills in a factory that feels reactive and alive, allowing for a fully immersive experience. Designed with approachability in mind, ridiculous failure is inevitable as you work your way to the top in this vibrant, witty and comedic stress-inducing Fail Factory!.", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a whimsical robot factory while climbing your way up the corporate ladder from lowly intern to esteemed star employee. In a wacky spectacle of increasing chaos, strive to keep up with the escalating comedy of errors as you operate various assembly lines in a myriad of mini-games. Entrenched in a physics-based, no consequences playground, experience three main types of mini-game stations, all with the goal to help the factory build robots on a massive scale."}]}, "developer_name": "Armature Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.meta.com/legal/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.meta.com/legal/quest/games-terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Oculus", "support_website_url": null, "web